的范围、行使有限制做了阐述,并提出建立预防与救济并重的股东知情权保护机制.": [0]}, "cited_by_count": 0, "primary_location": {"id": "mag:767858181", "doi": null, "is_oa": false, "landing_page_url": "http://www.cqvip.com/QK/80159X/200404/10011958.html", "pdf_url": null, "source": {"id": "https://openalex.org/S4306553887", "display_name": "浙江社会科学", "issn_l": null, "issn": null, "is_oa": false, "is_in_doaj": false, "is_core": false, "listed_in": [], "host_organization": null, "host_organization_name": null, "host_organization_lineage": [], "host_organization_lineage_names": [], "type": "journal"}, "license": null, "license_id": null, "version": null, "is_accepted": false, "is_published": false, "raw_source_name": "浙江社会科学", "raw_type": null}}, {"id": "https://openalex.org/W654592876", "doi": null, "title": "试论新《公司法》中的中小股东权益保护", "publication_date": "2007-01-01", "authorships": [{"author_position": "first", "author": {"id": "https://openalex.org/A5046635837", "display_name": "周梅", "orcid": null, "observed_orcids": []}, "institutions": [], "countries": [], "is_corresponding": true, "raw_author_name": "周梅", "raw_affiliation_strings": [], "raw_orcid": null, "affiliations": []}], "abstract_inverted_index": {"对中小股东权益的保护水平是衡量一部公司法公正和成熟与否的标准之一。新修改的《公司法》针对原有公司法的不足,从实体上和程序上为中小股东设计了一套完整的利益保护体系。本文主要从股东知情权、股份收买请求权、累积投票权、申请解散公司、股东诉讼、关联交易等角度,解读新《公司法》对中小股东权益的保护。": [0]}, "cited_by_count": 0, "primary_location": {"id": "mag:654592876", "doi": null, "is_oa": false, "landing_page_url": "http://www.cqvip.com/QK/83424A/200705/24677874.html", "pdf_url": null, "source": {"id": "https://openalex.org/S4306547486", "display_name": "宜宾学院学报", "issn_l": null, "issn": null, "is_oa": false, "is_in_doaj": false, "is_core": false, "listed_in": [], "host_organization": null, "host_organization_name": null, "host_organization_lineage": [], "host_organization_lineage_names": [], "type": "journal"}, "license": null, "license_id": null, "version": null, "is_accepted": false, "is_published": false, "raw_source_name": "宜宾学院学报", "raw_type": null}}, {"id": "https://openalex.org/W364163529", "doi": null, "title": "新《公司法》对中小股东保护之强化", "publication_date": "2006-01-01", "authorships": [{"author_position": "first", "author": {"id": "https://openalex.org/A5049646485", "display_name": "陈振宁", "orcid": null, "observed_orcids": []}, "institutions": [], "countries": [], "is_corresponding": true, "raw_author_name": "陈振宁", "raw_affiliation_strings": [], "raw_orcid": null, "affiliations": []}], "abstract_inverted_index": {"新《公司法》通过扩大股东知情权范围、完善股东会议召集程序和议事规划、完善股东退出机制、健全股东诉讼制度，极大地健全了股东合法权益保护机制，也大大强化了对中小股东的保护，但也留下了一些空白的疑义，尚需补充、完善。": [0]}, "cited_by_count": 0, "primary_location": {"id": "mag:364163529", "doi": null, "is_oa": false, "landing_page_url": "http://www.cqvip.com/qk/95786A/200606Z/22065271.html", "pdf_url": null, "source": {"id": "https://openalex.org/S4306545665", "display_name": "商场现代化", "issn_l": null, "issn": null, "is_oa": false, "is_in_doaj": false, "is_core": false, "listed_in": [], "host_organization": null, "host_organization_name": null, "host_organization_lineage": [], "host_organization_lineage_names": [], "type": "journal"}, "license": null, "license_id": null, "version": null, "is_accepted": false, "is_published": false, "raw_source_name": "商场现代化", "raw_type": null}}, {"id": "https://openalex.org/W819029220", "doi": null, "title": "略议新《公司法》对中小股东权益的保护", "publication_date": "2011-01-01", "authorships": [{"author_position": "first", "author": {"id": "https://openalex.org/A5079124793", "display_name": "许崇峰", "orcid": null, "observed_orcids": []}, "institutions": [], "countries": [], "is_corresponding": false, "raw_author_name": "许崇峰", "raw_affiliation_strings": [], "raw_orcid": null, "affiliations": []}, {"author_position": "last", "author": {"id": "https://openalex.org/A5063926244", "display_name": "关苏晴", "orcid": null, "observed_orcids": []}, "institutions": [], "countries": [], "is_corresponding": false, "raw_author_name": "关苏晴", "raw_affiliation_strings": [], "raw_orcid": null, "affiliations": []}], "abstract_inverted_index": {"随着中国市场经济的发展,旧《公司法》有关股东利益的保护机制弊端日益显露出来,2005年我国对公司法进行了比较全面的修订,形成了比较完善的股东利益保护机制,在公司管理实践中起到了很大的作用。新《公司法》主要从四个维度对中小股东的权益提供了保障：一是强化了股东知情权的保护,二是增设了累积投票制,三是提供了股东退出途径,四是健全了股东诉讼机制。": [0]}, "cited_by_count": 0, "primary_location": {"id": "mag:819029220", "doi": null, "is_oa": false, "landing_page_url": "http://www.cqvip.com/QK/70483X/201103/40761806.html", "pdf_url": null, "source": {"id": "https://openalex.org/S4306541137", "display_name": "中共郑州市委党校学报", "issn_l": null, "issn": null, "is_oa": false, "is_in_doaj": false, "is_core": false, "listed_in": [], "host_organization": null, "host_organization_name": null, "host_organization_lineage": [], "host_organization_lineage_names": [], "type": "journal"}, "license": null, "license_id": null, "version": null, "is_accepted": false, "is_published": false, "raw_source_name": "中共郑州市委党校学报", "raw_type": null}}, {"id": "https://openalex.org/W1042137016", "doi": null, "title": "论我国“证明责任倒置”规则", "publication_date": "2012-11-25", "authorships": [{"author_position": "first", "author": {"id": "https://openalex.org/A5028374194", "display_name": "包建华", "orcid": null, "observed_orcids": []}, "institutions": [], "countries": [], "is_corresponding": true, "raw_author_name": "包建华", "raw_affiliation_strings": [], "raw_orcid": null, "affiliations": []}], "abstract_inverted_index": {"我国目前的证明责任倒置规则主要可以归纳为四类:第一,对于消极事实的倒置,主要集中在否认公司人格之诉和著作权侵权之诉当中；第二,对于积极事实的倒置,主要集中在专利侵权之诉和劳动争议当中；第三,对于过错事实的倒置,主要适用于侵权事实发生在被告掌控的场所和被告因为自己的获利行为使大众承受风险的情形；第四,对于因果关系的倒置,主要出现在环境污染和共同危险行为侵权之诉中.我国目前的证明责任倒置规则存在不足,在股东知情权诉讼、关联交易、不当得利和无因管理之诉当中,也应当适用证明责任的倒置.": [0]}, "cited_by_count": 0, "primary_location": {"id": "mag:1042137016", "doi": null, "is_oa": false, "landing_page_url": "http://xuebao.neu.edu.cn/social/CN/abstract/abstract263.shtml", "pdf_url": null, "source": {"id": "https://openalex.org/S4306541041", "display_name": "东北大学学报：社会科学版", "issn_l": null, "issn": null, "is_oa": false, "is_in_doaj": false, "is_core": false, "listed_in": [], "host_organization": null, "host_organization_name": null, "host_organization_lineage": [], "host_organization_lineage_names": [], "type": "journal"}, "license": null, "license_id": null, "version": null, "is_accepted": false, "is_published": false, "raw_source_name": "东北大学学报：社会科学版", "raw_type": null}}, {"id": "https://openalex.org/W2254318384", "doi": null, "title": "《公司法》修订在即，中小股东利益该如何保护", "publication_date": "2004-01-01", "authorships": [{"author_position": "first", "author": {"id": "https://openalex.org/A5007480541", "display_name": "陈红飞", "orcid": null, "observed_orcids": []}, "institutions": [], "countries": [], "is_corresponding": false, "raw_author_name": "陈红飞", "raw_affiliation_strings": [], "raw_orcid": null, "affiliations": []}, {"author_position": "middle", "author": {"id": "https://openalex.org/A5090143364", "display_name": "杨剑", "orcid": null, "observed_orcids": []}, "institutions": [], "countries": [], "is_corresponding": false, "raw_author_name": "杨剑", "raw_affiliation_strings": [], "raw_orcid": null, "affiliations": []}, {"author_position": "last", "author": {"id": "https://openalex.org/A5021509390", "display_name": "柳慧亚", "orcid": null, "observed_orcids": []}, "institutions": [], "countries": [], "is_corresponding": false, "raw_author_name": "柳慧亚", "raw_affiliation_strings": [], "raw_orcid": null, "affiliations": []}], "abstract_inverted_index": {"我国于1994年实施的《公司法》已不能适应社会投资和公司实践的发展，《公司法》修订迫在眉睫。《公司法》修订在突出对股东保护的同时，应特别强化对中小股东的保护，明确股东的利益分配权、剩余财产分配权、股份回购请求权、新股认购优先权、公司信息知情权、提案权、质讯权以及代表公司对董事、经理、监事提起诉讼的权利，引入优先股和累积投票制度，使中小股东能够更充分地行使自己的权力，维护自己的利益。": [0]}, "cited_by_count": 0, "primary_location": {"id": "mag:2254318384", "doi": null, "is_oa": false, "landing_page_url": "http://www.cqvip.com/QK/90213X/200407/9595829.html", "pdf_url": null, "source": {"id": "https://openalex.org/S4306553890", "display_name": "浙江经济", "issn_l": null, "issn": null, "is_oa": false, "is_in_doaj": false, "is_core": false, "listed_in": [], "host_organization": null, "host_organization_name": null, "host_organization_lineage": [], "host_organization_lineage_names": [], "type": "journal"}, "license": null, "license_id": null, "version": null, "is_accepted": false, "is_published": false, "raw_source_name": "浙江经济", "raw_type": null}}, {"id": "https://openalex.org/W10145699", "doi": null, "title": "中小股东利益保护机制的完善——兼评《新公司法》", "publication_date": "2008-01-01", "authorships": [{"author_position": "first", "author": {"id": "https://openalex.org/A5041935668", "display_name": "邱健", "orcid": null, "observed_orcids": []}, "institutions": [], "countries": [], "is_corresponding": false, "raw_author_name": "邱健", "raw_affiliation_strings": [], "raw_orcid": null, "affiliations": []}, {"author_position": "last", "author": {"id": "https://openalex.org/A5077149563", "display_name": "陈兆松", "orcid": null, "observed_orcids": []}, "institutions": [], "countries": [], "is_corresponding": false, "raw_author_name": "陈兆松", "raw_affiliation_strings": [], "raw_orcid": null, "affiliations": []}], "abstract_inverted_index": {"本文从分析《新公司法》的修订内容出发，探讨我国在保护中小股东利益方面加强法律规定的诸多努力和改进，如：股东知情范围扩大、股东代表诉讼权、股东退出机制、股东可以申请公司破产、累计投票制的增加和董事会制度的细化等等。同时也指出《新公司法》在完善中小股东利益保护机制上仍存在局限性，需进一步改进，如：股东知情范围的扩大留有隐患、缺乏股东的事前救济方式和独立董事问题等。": [0]}, "cited_by_count": 0, "primary_location": {"id": "mag:10145699", "doi": null, "is_oa": false, "landing_page_url": "http://www.cqvip.com/qk/81513X/200810/28296814.html", "pdf_url": null, "source": {"id": "https://openalex.org/S4306557979", "display_name": "西南金融", "issn_l": null, "issn": null, "is_oa": false, "is_in_doaj": false, "is_core": false, "listed_in": [], "host_organization": null, "host_organization_name": null, "host_organization_lineage": [], "host_organization_lineage_names": [], "type": "journal"}, "license": null, "license_id": null, "version": null, "is_accepted": false, "is_published": false, "raw_source_name": "西南金融", "raw_type": null}}, {"id": "https://openalex.org/W2257347526", "doi": null, "title": "建立股东中心主义治理模式——新《公司法》（2005）的创新与完善", "publication_date": "2007-01-01", "authorships": [{"author_position": "first", "author": {"id": "https://openalex.org/A5070755795", "display_name": "刘新民", "orcid": null, "observed_orcids": []}, "institutions": [], "countries": [], "is_corresponding": true, "raw_author_name": "刘新民", "raw_affiliation_strings": [], "raw_orcid": null, "affiliations": []}], "abstract_inverted_index": {"新《公司法》的股东中心主义模式的建立体现在：加强了股东权利保护的同时也加强了股东权利保护的程序性规定。但新《公司法》仍然是一部过渡性特点明显的法律,需要在实施过程中不断完善,尤其在公司治理方面,应从对公司转投资进行限制,强化有限责任公司股东的知情权,进一步改进累积投票制,完善股东衍生诉讼制度,对公司压迫提供救济等几个方面加以改进。": [0]}, "cited_by_count": 0, "primary_location": {"id": "mag:2257347526", "doi": null, "is_oa": false, "landing_page_url": "http://www.cqvip.com/QK/82357X/200708/25114338.html", "pdf_url": null, "source": {"id": "https://openalex.org/S4306547154", "display_name": "学习论坛", "issn_l": null, "issn": null, "is_oa": false, "is_in_doaj": false, "is_core": false, "listed_in": [], "host_organization": null, "host_organization_name": null, "host_organization_lineage": [], "host_organization_lineage_names": [], "type": "journal"}, "license": null, "license_id": null, "version": null, "is_accepted": false, "is_published": false, "raw_source_name": "学习论坛", "raw_type": null}}, {"id": "https://openalex.org/W4414048305", "doi": "https://doi.org/10.63887/fem.2025.1.5.53", "title": "异议股东回购请求权的规范行使", "publication_date": "2025-09-07", "authorships": [{"author_position": "first", "author": {"id": "https://openalex.org/A5119564172", "display_name": "颜飞", "orcid": null, "observed_orcids": []}, "institutions": [{"id": "https://openalex.org/I290007724", "display_name": "Qinghai University for Nationalities", "ror": "https://ror.org/01e7csr82", "country_code": "CN", "type": "education", "lineage": ["https://openalex.org/I290007724"]}], "countries": ["CN"], "is_corresponding": true, "raw_author_name": "颜飞", "raw_affiliation_strings": ["青海民族大学法学院"], "raw_orcid": null, "affiliations": [{"raw_affiliation_string": "青海民族大学法学院", "institution_ids": ["https://openalex.org/I290007724"]}]}], "abstract_inverted_index": {"新公司法利益平衡原则为基石，保障异议股东与债权人权益的协调。规范内容上，通过完善权利行使程序（如申请时限、协商机制）与适用条件（如法定回购情形），以形式标准（程序合规）与实质标准（定价合理性）双重约束，防范权利滥用。主体规范上，需基于合法性（如股东资格认定）与合理性（如利益受损程度）界定行权主体范围，避免泛化或遗漏，最终促进公司、股东及债权人三方利益的动态平衡。为了合理约束异议股东权利，保障债权人合法利益，进而加强公司稳定的正常经营，有必要对异议股东回购请求权规范行使。": [0]}, "cited_by_count": 0, "primary_location": {"id": "doi:10.63887/fem.2025.1.5.53", "doi": "https://doi.org/10.63887/fem.2025.1.5.53", "is_oa": true, "landing_page_url": "https://doi.org/10.63887/fem.2025.1.5.53", "pdf_url": "https://www.sci-open.net/index.php/FEM/article/download/2507/3319", "source": {"id": "https://openalex.org/S5407047649", "display_name": "经济管理前沿", "issn_l": "3058-9193", "issn": ["3058-9193", "3059-0248"], "is_oa": false, "is_in_doaj": false, "is_core": false, "listed_in": [], "host_organization": null, "host_organization_name": null, "host_organization_lineage": [], "host_organization_lineage_names": [], "type": "journal"}, "license": null, "license_id": null, "version": "publishedVersion", "is_accepted": true, "is_published": true, "raw_source_name": "经济管理前沿", "raw_type": "journal-article"}}, {"id": "https://openalex.org/W4254144754", "doi": "https://doi.org/10.26549/cjygl.v4i4.3894", "title": "科创板实施背景下律师的非诉讼业务探究", "publication_date": "2020-05-28", "authorships": [{"author_position": "first", "author": {"id": "https://openalex.org/A5045316596", "display_name": "倩 景", "orcid": null, "observed_orcids": []}, "institutions": [{"id": "https://openalex.org/I165745306", "display_name": "Southwest Petroleum University", "ror": "https://ror.org/03h17x602", "country_code": "CN", "type": "education", "lineage": ["https://openalex.org/I165745306"]}], "countries": ["CN"], "is_corresponding": true, "raw_author_name": "倩 景", "raw_affiliation_strings": ["西南石油大学，中国"], "raw_orcid": null, "affiliations": [{"raw_affiliation_string": "西南石油大学，中国", "institution_ids": ["https://openalex.org/I165745306"]}]}], "abstract_inverted_index": {"科创板是在新时代下提出的符合经济发展新要求、新趋势的新板块。": [0], "这一新改革是中国资本市场的重大突破，旨在更好地利用前景广阔的企业，优化科创企业结构，增强市场包容性，强化市场功能。": [1], "在整个过程中，为了保证相关企业在各个环节所实施行为的规范性和专业性，律师事务所作为中介机构起着重要的配合作用，": [2], "律师通过进行相关的非诉讼业务，辅助、引导企业更好地进入科创板市场。": [3]}, "cited_by_count": 2, "primary_location": {"id": "doi:10.26549/cjygl.v4i4.3894", "doi": "https://doi.org/10.26549/cjygl.v4i4.3894", "is_oa": true, "landing_page_url": "https://doi.org/10.26549/cjygl.v4i4.3894", "pdf_url": "https://ojs.s-p.sg/index.php/cjygl/article/download/3894/pdf", "source": {"id": "https://openalex.org/S4210171802", "display_name": "财经与管理", "issn_l": "2529-783X", "issn": ["2529-783X", "2529-7848"], "is_oa": true, "is_in_doaj": false, "is_core": false, "listed_in": [], "host_organization": "https://openalex.org/P4324004150", "host_organization_name": "Synergy Publishing Pte. Ltd.", "host_organization_lineage": ["https://openalex.org/P4324004150"], "host_organization_lineage_names": ["Synergy Publishing Pte. Ltd."], "type": "journal"}, "license": "cc-by-nc", "license_id": "https://openalex.org/licenses/cc-by-nc", "version": "publishedVersion", "is_accepted": true, "is_published": true, "raw_source_name": "财经与管理", "raw_type": "journal-article"}}, {"id": "https://openalex.org/W7214430401", "doi": "https://doi.org/10.70693/202608028613", "title": "新《公司法》适用下破产股东出资追缴的困境与纾解 ——基于责任识别至权利救济的全流程规范展开", "publication_date": "2026-09-08", "authorships": [{"author_position": "first", "author": {"id": "https://openalex.org/A5084577143", "display_name": "Yuhuan Pu", "orcid": null, "observed_orcids": []}, "institutions": [], "countries": [], "is_corresponding": true, "raw_author_name": "蒲余欢", "raw_affiliation_strings": ["嘉兴大学文法学院"], "raw_orcid": null, "affiliations": [{"raw_affiliation_string": "嘉兴大学文法学院", "institution_ids": []}]}], "abstract_inverted_index": {"新《公司法》实施后，与《企业破产法》在股东出资追缴方面存在适用冲突，司法实践裁判尺度不一、个别债权人借助加速到期规则规避破产集体清偿。结合裁判数据与管理人实务调研，通过规范解释搭建出资追缴全流程分析框架，区分各类出资瑕疵认定标准，划定追缴路径适用顺序，建立分层追缴机制；确立破产程序优先规则，明晰股权转让责任新旧法适用界限，追缴费用按破产费用优先清偿，区分清算、重整、和解设置差异化财产处置规则，配套股东追偿、债权人追加分配、管理人追责救济渠道，打通两法衔接路径，平衡债权人受偿权益与股东责任边界，形成适配破产实务的一体化处置方案，统一类案裁判标准、规范管理人